function screenAds(){return metricPage('ADS ภาพรวม','เลือก metric แล้วแตะทีมเพื่อดู PS',data.ds||summaryRow(data.ps||[],'ADS'),data.ads||[],{title:'ADS Performance'})}
function screenPs(){const first=adsId((data.ads||[])[0]),sel=state.ads||first,rows=(data.ps||[]).filter(x=>adsId(x)===sel),ads=(data.ads||[]).filter(x=>adsId(x)===sel),summary=summaryRow(rows,sel),fallback=ads.length?ads:[{ads:sel,name:sel,...summary}];return metricPage(sel+' · PS','Seller Report Detail',summary,fallback,{title:'PS ใน '+sel,forceOpen:true})}
function initials(r){const name=String(r?.name||r?.psName||r?.ps||r?.psCode||'PS').trim(),parts=name.split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);return E(parts.length>1?(parts[0].charAt(0)+parts[1].charAt(0)):name.slice(0,2))}
function calcCard(r,k){const v=metricData(r,k),t=N(v.target),a=N(v.actual),idx=t?a/t*100:N(v.index),full=Math.max(t-a,0),d=Math.max(daysLeft(),1),pv=pctVal(k),has=String(pv??'').trim()!=='',pn=N(pv),goal=has?t*pn/100:0,need=has?Math.max(goal-a,0):0,per=has?need/d:0;return`<div class='person-metric-detail'><div class='metric-detail-grid'><div><span>Target</span><b class='num'>${M(t)}</b></div><div><span>Actual</span><b class='num'>${M(a)}</b></div><div><span>ขาด</span><b class='num'>${M(full)}</b></div></div><label class='pctBox'><span>คำนวณเป้า</span><input data-pct='${E(k)}' inputmode='decimal' type='number' min='0' max='150' step='1' value='${E(pv)}' placeholder='ใส่ %'><strong class='num'>%</strong></label><small>${has?'เป้า '+P(pn)+' = '+M(goal)+' · ต้องทำ '+M(need)+' · วันละ '+M(per)+' / '+M(d)+' วัน':'กรอก % เพื่อคำนวณเป้าและยอดที่ต้องทำ'}</small></div>`}
function workCard(){const m=data?.meta||{},d=daysLeft(),wd=N(m.workdayNo),tw=N(m.totalWorkdays);return`<div class='work-note'><span>วันทำงานเหลือ</span><b class='num'>${M(d)}</b><small>WD ${wd?M(wd):'-'}${tw?' / '+M(tw):''}</small></div>`}
